notes.content:
The game was played more than 6000 times! Thank you for the support, reviews and comments! We prepared a few things to make the game better.

The latest update includes:
- Spanish localization! 
- Access to controls. Customize your inputs in a way you like;
- some minor bugs fixed;

We are working on the next update now.

Thank you for playing and supporting our debut project. We read your comments and work hard to make the game better!

The latest update includes:
- New feature: dash. Allows you to move faster and avoid the danger;
- Tutorial level updated with the new rooms and a proper intro;
- some bugs and issues were fixed;

Update 1.5 is on the way.

Over 5000 players for the past 3 weeks. The game becomes better with every update thanks to your feedback and support! 
Here is a few changes we made this time:

- Russian language localization!
- NPC fast dialog bug fixed;
- numerous tech bugs and level design issues were fixed as well;

We are working on the update 1.4 now.

Update 1.2 is now available!

Over 4000 people played the game! Thank you for your support!

We are keep listening your feedback and working on the improvements. 
The list of changes:
- you can change your graphic settings to improve the performance;
- AI can't see through the walls anymore;
- a few level design updates and bugfixes;

Update 1.3 is on the way.
